OL,3,GNEWSACeltic fan banned for two years
OL,4,Aover Shankland gesture
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Celtic fan who made an offensive
OL,7,Fgesture to ex-Hearts player Lawrence
OL,8,FShankland during a pitch invasion has
OL,9,Fbeen banned from football matches for
OL,10,Ftwo years and ordered to do unpaid
OL,11,Fwork.
OL,13,FLiam Connolly, 37, entered the Celtic
OL,14,FPark pitch after his side were
OL,15,Fvictorious against the Edinburgh club
OL,16,Fon 16 May, a result that clinched the
OL,17,Fleague title for the Hoops.
OL,19,FHe went on to approach then Hearts
OL,20,Fstriker Shankland, 31, and made an
OL,21,F"offensive gesture" towards him.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,425,420,260,160,0,100
